answer: Try it as an experiment if it is feasible (the author, 2026-10-10). The separate sidebar stays the default and keeps getting M9's work; the docked mode is built behind a per-device flag in `chrome.storage.local`, off by default, so it can be tried and thrown away without touching the main path. Q-8 is answered by the experiment's result, not by this decision.
