ty group to its section position when it gets its first item and back when emptied. U4: item rows live in `<div id=wlp-section-<id> class=wlp-items-list>` rendered only when open; the dropBefore/After line logic is unchanged. U10: the section row is self-contained (header + toggle + list) and the empty rows are plain buttons, reusable inside Google's nav. README feature lines updated. Unverified: not loaded in Chrome; nothing seen rendered (either theme, 280 px fit, Google's global h3/button styles against the resets, chevron rotation, hover/drop highlights); drag into a folded header / empty row and the jump on first item not exercised; screen-reader announcement of the toggle and count not heard; startAddTo focus while the form animates open not observed; cross-device sync of the fold not tested.
